@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Campaign

[*] --> Assigned

state "Assigned" as Assigned
state "Approved & Contract Signed" as Approved
state "Prepare adverts" as PrepareAdverts
state "Approve & Schedule Adverts" as ApproveSchedule
state "Running" as Running
state "Extension/Adjustment" as Extension
state "Complete Campaign & Final Statement" as Complete
state "Handle Payment" as HandlePayment
state "Wait for Balance" as WaitBalance
state "Mark Paid" as MarkPaid
state "Archive & Release Staff" as ArchiveRelease

Assigned --> Approved : Manager and staff assigned
Approved --> PrepareAdverts : Everything approved, contract signed
PrepareAdverts --> ApproveSchedule : Adverts prepared
ApproveSchedule --> Running : Adverts scheduled
Running --> Extension : Campaign running
Running --> Complete : All adverts finished
Extension --> Running : Campaign extended/adjusted
Complete --> HandlePayment : Campaign completed
HandlePayment --> WaitBalance : Payment handled, balance check
WaitBalance --> MarkPaid : Balance settled
MarkPaid --> ArchiveRelease : Campaign marked as paid
ArchiveRelease --> [*] : Campaign archived, staff released

@enduml
